---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
description: "Vyvíjíme software na míru, tvoříme webové stránky a spravujeme reklamy, které pomáhají firmám růst. OP Digital – Ondřej a Patrik."
---

{# ===================== HERO ===================== #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden min-h-[calc(100svh-4rem)] md:min-h-[calc(100svh-7.5rem)] flex flex-col justify-center bg-grid" data-hero>
  {# Pozadí: obří obrys loga + oranžový blok #}
  <img src="/assets/img/bg/mark-outline.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-[18vw] -top-[6vw] w-[70vw] max-w-none opacity-80 hidden md:block" data-drift="right">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-0 bottom-0 h-2 w-[40vw] bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="wrap relative py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-8 md:mb-12" data-reveal>Digitální agentura · Ondřej &amp; Patrik</p>

    <div data-hero-scale class="origin-top-left">
      <h1
        class="text-[clamp(2.5rem,8.2vw,9.75rem)] font-bold uppercase tracking-[-0.05em] leading-[0.85] text-balance"
        x-data="rotator(['systémy', 'webové stránky', 'poptávkové kampaně'])"
      >
        <span class="block" data-reveal="clip">Stavíme</span>
        <span class="block text-accent min-h-[1.7em] md:min-h-[0.85em]" data-reveal="clip" data-reveal-delay="0.1">
          <span x-text="text">systémy</span><span class="inline-block w-[0.06em] h-[0.78em] align-baseline bg-accent ml-[0.04em] animate-blink motion-reduce:hidden" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="block" data-reveal="clip" data-reveal-delay="0.2">na míru<span class="text-accent">.</span></span>
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 md:mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-end">
      <p class="lead lg:col-span-7 max-w-2xl" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.3">{{ site.description }}</p>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 lg:justify-end" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.4">
        <a href="/kontakt/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Pojďme to probrat <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a href="#projekty" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Naše práce <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===================== RYCHLÝ MARQUEE (oranžový pás) ===================== #}
<div class="marquee bg-accent text-accent-fg py-3 md:py-4 border-y-2 border-accent" style="--marquee-duration: 22s" aria-hidden="true">
  {% for copy in [1, 2] %}
    <ul class="marquee__track gap-8 pr-8 text-xl md:text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter">
      {% for w in ["Systémy na míru", "Webové stránky", "Meta Ads kampaně", "Automatizace", "Klientské portály", "Landing pages", "Poptávky, ne lajky"] %}
        <li class="flex items-center gap-8"><span>{{ w }}</span><span class="text-base md:text-xl">✦</span></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

{# ===================== SLUŽBY ===================== #}
<section id="sluzby" class="section relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-12 md:mb-20">
      <h2 class="headline text-balance max-w-4xl" data-reveal="clip">Co pro vás můžeme postavit<span class="text-accent">?</span></h2>
      <p class="lead max-w-md" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1">Tři věci, které umíme opravdu dobře. Každá sama o sobě funguje, dohromady dávají firmě tah na branku.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      {% for s in services %}
        <a
          href="/{{ s.slug }}/"
          class="card-flood group flex flex-col {% if s.featured %}md:col-span-2 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12 lg:items-end min-h-[60vh]{% else %}min-h-[50vh]{% endif %}"
          data-reveal
          {% if not loop.first %}data-reveal-delay="{{ (loop.index0 * 0.1) }}"{% endif %}
        >
          <span class="card-number giant-number absolute -top-6 -right-4 md:-right-8" aria-hidden="true">{{ s.number }}</span>

          <div class="relative {% if s.featured %}lg:col-span-7{% endif %} flex flex-col h-full">
            <p class="eyebrow mb-8">{{ s.number }} / {{ s.label }}</p>
            <h3 class="card-title {% if s.featured %}text-[clamp(2.25rem,5.5vw,5.5rem)]{% else %}text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.75rem)]{% endif %} font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.9] mb-6 text-balance">{{ s.title }}</h3>
            <p class="card-title text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">{{ s.tagline }}</p>
            <p class="card-text text-lg md:text-xl leading-tight max-w-2xl mb-8">{{ s.text }}</p>
            <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-10">
              {% for t in s.tags %}<li class="tag card-tag">{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}
            </ul>
            <span class="card-title mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-lg md:text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter">
              {{ s.linkLabel }}
              <span class="inline-block transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </span>
          </div>

          {% if s.featured %}
            {# Místo pro ukázku skutečného systému (screenshot) #}
            <div class="relative lg:col-span-5 mt-10 lg:mt-0 border-2 border-line group-hover:border-accent-fg/30 aspect-[4/3] flex items-end p-6 bg-muted-deep group-hover:bg-accent-fg/10 transition-colors duration-300 bg-grid" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="absolute inset-x-6 top-6 h-2 w-16 bg-accent group-hover:bg-accent-fg"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-x-6 top-12 space-y-2">
                {% for w in [80, 55, 65, 40] %}<div class="h-2 bg-line/60 group-hover:bg-accent-fg/20" style="width: {{ w }}%"></div>{% endfor %}
              </div>
              <p class="card-text text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">Ukázka systému</p>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===================== PROJEKTY ===================== #}
<section id="projekty" class="section relative overflow-hidden">
  <span class="giant-number absolute -top-8 -left-4 hidden lg:block" aria-hidden="true" data-drift="right">04</span>
  <div class="wrap relative">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-8" data-reveal>04 / Projekty</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-12 md:mb-20">
      <h2 class="headline text-balance" data-reveal="clip">Nedávno dokončené projekty<span class="text-accent">.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead max-w-md" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1">Každý projekt je jiný. Někde stavíme vše od základů, jinde hledáme způsob, jak posunout fungující byznys ještě dál. Tady je pár nedávno dokončených projektů.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8" data-reveal-group>
      {% for cs in caseStudies %}
        {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
          {% set wide = cs.featured %}
          {% include "partials/case-card.njk" %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex justify-center">
      <a href="/pripadove-studie/" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Všechny případové studie <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===================== REFERENCE ===================== #}
<section id="reference" class="section relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="wrap mb-12 md:mb-16">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-8" data-reveal>05 / Reference</p>
    <h2 class="headline text-balance" data-reveal="clip">Firmy, které nám důvěřují<span class="text-accent">.</span></h2>
  </div>

  {# Dva protiběžné pásy #}
  <div class="space-y-0" data-reveal>
    {% set marqueeSpeed = 60 %}{% set marqueeInvert = false %}
    {% include "partials/marquee-clients.njk" %}
  </div>

  <div class="wrap mt-12 md:mt-16">
    <ul class="hairline-grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4" data-reveal-group>
      {% for c in clients %}
        <li class="flex items-center justify-center min-h-28 md:min-h-36 p-6 text-center hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-fg transition-colors duration-300" data-reveal-item>
          {% if c.logo %}
            <img src="{{ c.logo }}" alt="{{ c.name }}" class="max-h-12 w-auto" loading="lazy">
          {% else %}
            <span class="text-base md:text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">{{ c.name }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===================== SPOLUPRÁCE – sticky karty ===================== #}
<section id="spoluprace" class="section relative">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
      {# Levý sloupec: zůstává přilepený, zatímco karty rolují #}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-40">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-8" data-reveal>06 / Spolupráce</p>
          <h2 class="headline text-balance mb-8" data-reveal="clip">Od nápadu k hotové věci<span class="text-accent">.</span></h2>
          <p class="lead max-w-md" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1">Nemusíte mít všechno promyšlené do posledního detailu. Stačí nám říct, co řešíte. Společně najdeme cestu, jak to dostat do praxe.</p>
          <a href="/kontakt/" class="btn btn-primary mt-10 hidden lg:inline-flex" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.2">Začít prvním krokem <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# Pravý sloupec: karty se na sebe vrství #}
      <ol class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 lg:space-y-8">
        {% for step in process %}
          <li class="lg:sticky border-2 border-line bg-bg p-8 md:p-12 min-h-[40vh] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group hover:border-accent transition-colors duration-300" style="top: calc(7rem + {{ loop.index0 }} * 1.5rem)">
            <span class="giant-number absolute -top-8 -right-4 group-hover:text-accent/15 transition-colors duration-300" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index | pad }}</span>
            <p class="relative eyebrow">Krok {{ loop.index | pad }} / {{ process.length | pad }}</p>
            <div class="relative mt-16">
              <h3 class="title mb-4 text-balance">{{ step.title }}</h3>
              <p class="text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl leading-tight text-muted-fg max-w-xl">{{ step.text }}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===================== TÝM ===================== #}
{% include "partials/team.njk" %}

{# ===================== LOGA (pomalu) + KONTAKT ===================== #}
{% set marqueeSpeed = 90 %}{% set marqueeInvert = true %}
{% include "partials/marquee-clients.njk" %}

{% include "partials/contact.njk" %}
